From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:51:11 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] pico8-carts

One PICO-8 cart for every game, RetroShell::Pico8, drawn by us to the
proportions every PICO-8 cart export shares (160x205, measured on 39
exports): rounded top corners and bottom left corner, a 10 px cut at the
bottom right, a square label well where the export keeps its 128x128
picture (16, 24), and the darker title strip below it (15, 163, 130x32).
Seated 240x308, drawn 312x400, PICO-8 grey 64 64 64 (the export's body,
whose low two bits carry cart data). The label is the cart's own picture,
which tools/fetch-labels.py crops into Labels/PICO8. Lit into
assets/retro/pico8_neutral.png by examples/retro_neutrals.rs; every other
neutral regenerates byte for byte.
---
 crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart.svg          |   3 +
 crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart_detail.svg   |   3 +
 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/pico8_neutral.png | Bin 0 -> 181914 bytes
 crates/slot-ui/examples/retro_neutrals.rs     |   4 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/cart.rs                    |  10 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/lib.rs                     |   4 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_cart.rs              |  24 +++-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_face.rs              |   4 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_shell.rs             |   3 +
 crates/slot-ui/tests/pico8_cart.rs            | 122 ++++++++++++++++++
 crates/slot-ui/tests/render_nes_shelves.rs    |   5 +-
 crates/slot-ui/tests/retro_bitmap.rs          |   5 +-
 12 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart_detail.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/pico8_neutral.png
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/tests/pico8_cart.rs

diff --git a/crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart.svg b/crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart.svg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..64e2ee5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart.svg
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 160 205">
+  <path d="M 1.00 4.00 A 3.00 3.00 0 0 1 4.00 1.00 L 156.00 1.00 A 3.00 3.00 0 0 1 159.00 4.00 L 159.00 195.00 L 149.00 205.00 L 4.00 205.00 A 3.00 3.00 0 0 1 1.00 202.00 Z" fill="#fff"/>
+</svg>
diff --git a/crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart_detail.svg b/crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart_detail.svg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..400c37a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/crates/slot-ui/assets/pico8_cart_detail.svg
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 160 205">
+  <path d="M 15.00 163.00 L 145.00 163.00 L 145.00 195.00 L 15.00 195.00 Z" fill="#000" fill-opacity="0.85"/>
+</svg>
